# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  VOYGE.studio — Environment Variables
#  Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your keys.
#  Never commit .env.local to source control.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── AI: GitHub Models (GPT-5) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Powers all travel spot extraction and location intelligence.
# Get your token at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scope: read:packages (or any fine-grained token with Models access)
# Model used: gpt-5  (available on GitHub Models — https://github.com/marketplace/models)
GITHUB_MODELS_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here

# ── Scraping: RapidAPI Master Key ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# One key covers ALL of the following APIs (subscribe to each on RapidAPI):
#
#   📸 INSTAGRAM (subscribe to all 2):
#   1. instagram120          → https://rapidapi.com/3205/api/instagram120
#      └─ Primary post scraper (caption, thumbnail). Already the existing API.
#   2. instagram-scraper-api2 → https://rapidapi.com/social-api2-instasnap/api/instagram-scraper-api2
#      └─ Rich data: native location tag, GPS coords, hashtags, author username,
#         top comments, and user bio. FREE tier available.
#
#   🎵 TIKTOK (subscribe to 1):
#   3. tiktok-scraper7       → https://rapidapi.com/tikwm-tikwm-default/api/tiktok-scraper7
#      └─ Comments scraper (mirrors tikwm.com). FREE tier available.
#      Note: Video info + user bio use tikwm.com directly (NO key needed, 5000 req/day free).
#
# Get your RapidAPI key at: https://rapidapi.com/developer/dashboard
RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here

# ── Maps: Mapbox ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Powers the interactive map, geocoding, and route optimization.
# Get your token at: https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# Required scopes: styles:read, tiles:read, geocoding, optimization
# Note: NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix makes this available client-side (for the map component).
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_public_token_here

# ── Images: Pexels ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fallback high-quality travel photos when the scraped thumbnail is unavailable.
# Get your free API key at: https://www.pexels.com/api/
# Free tier: 200 req/hour, 20,000 req/month — more than enough.
PEXELS_API_KEY=your_pexels_api_key_here

# ── Location Pipeline: GeoNames (natural features) ───────────────────────────
# Used by Stage 2 geocoder for rivers, lakes, mountains, national parks.
# Free account at: https://www.geonames.org/login
# Free tier: 20,000 credits/hour — sufficient for all natural feature queries.
GEONAMES_USERNAME=your_geonames_username_here

# ── Location Pipeline: HERE Geocoding ────────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 2 geocoder fallback — excellent POI coverage, especially in Asia/ME.
# Get your API key at: https://developer.here.com/
# Free tier: 250,000 transactions/month — more than enough.
HERE_API_KEY=your_here_api_key_here

# ── Location Pipeline: OpenCage Geocoding ────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 2 geocoder fallback with 0–10 confidence scores.
# Get your API key at: https://opencagedata.com/
# Free tier: 2,500 requests/day.
OPENCAGE_API_KEY=your_opencage_api_key_here

# ── Location Pipeline: Google Knowledge Graph ─────────────────────────────────
# Stage 3 verifier — confirms a place is real and gets its type/description.
# Enable at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/kgsearch.googleapis.com
# Free tier: 100,000 requests/day.
GOOGLE_KG_API_KEY=your_google_kg_api_key_here

# ── Location Pipeline: Google Cloud Vision ────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 4 — landmark detection from thumbnail images.
# Enable at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/vision.googleapis.com
# Free tier: 1,000 units/month (each image = 1 unit for landmark detection).
# Pipeline gracefully skips this stage if the key is not set.
GOOGLE_VISION_KEY=your_google_vision_api_key_here

# ── Telegram Bot ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Telegram bot lets users forward Instagram/TikTok links directly to their
# VOYGE map without opening a browser.
# Create a bot at: https://t.me/BotFather  → /newbot
# Then set your webhook to: https://your-domain.com/api/telegram
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  COMPLETELY FREE APIs (no key required — used automatically):
#
#  • tikwm.com                → TikTok video details + user bio (5,000 req/day/IP)
#  • tiktok.com/oembed        → TikTok fallback metadata (unlimited, public)
#  • Firestore Cache          → analysis_cache collection prevents duplicate API calls
#  • Wikipedia API            → Place verification + GPS coordinates (Stage 3, unlimited)
#  • Nominatim (OSM)          → Geocoding fallback (Stage 2, 1 req/s, no key needed)
#  • OSM Overpass API         → Natural feature queries: rivers, waterfalls, mountains (Stage 2)
#
#  LOCATION PIPELINE STAGES (src/lib/location/):
#  Stage 1 — extractor.ts    : Zero-compute text extraction (no API calls, instant)
#  Stage 2 — geocoder.ts     : Multi-API cascade: Mapbox → Nominatim → GeoNames → HERE → OpenCage → Overpass
#  Stage 3 — verifier.ts     : Wikipedia + Google Knowledge Graph place verification
#  Stage 4 — vision.ts       : Google Cloud Vision landmark detection from thumbnails
#  Stage 5 — ai-agent.ts     : GPT-5 agent with tool-calling (last resort, conf < 0.60)
#  Orchestrator — pipeline.ts: Runs all stages, confidence scoring, module-level cache
#
#  REMOVED (no longer needed):
#  • NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL      ← deleted, Firebase is used exclusively
#  • NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY ← deleted, Firebase is used exclusively
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
